  ["The cruise ship also has an indoor heated pool, restaurant, bar, lounge, squash court, etc., for you to pass the time."] = "O navio de cruzeiro conta ainda com piscina coberta aquecida, restaurante, bar, lounge, quadra de squash, etc., para você passar o tempo.",
