  ["Golden Autumn Lake Man"] = "Homem Dourado do Lago Outono",
  ["Golden Autumn Lakeside"] = "Lago Dourado de Outono",
  ["There is an elderly traveler with amnesia by Golden Autumn Lake, searching for their scattered memories."] = "Há um viajante idoso com amnésia perto do Lago Golden Autumn, em busca de suas memórias dispersas.",
  ["The people of Golden Autumn Lake love peace, are hardworking and simple, and do not actively explore the mysterious things around them."] = "O povo de Golden Autumn Lake ama a paz, é trabalhador e simples e não explora ativamente as coisas misteriosas ao seu redor.",
  ["The treasure of Golden Autumn Lake is said to be from the Fourth Epoch."] = "Diz-se que o tesouro do Lago Dourado do Outono pertence à Quarta Época.",
  ["Golden Autumn Lake Sightseeing Photo: \nLocated in the north of Loen, Golden Autumn Lake is the kingdom's timber supply base. \nThe Tree of Abundance grows on the ruins, quietly witnessing the endless life on this land."] = "Foto turística de Golden Autumn Lake: \nLocalizado no norte de Loen, Golden Autumn Lake é a base de fornecimento de madeira do reino. \nA Árvore da Abundância cresce nas ruínas, testemunhando silenciosamente a vida infinita nesta terra.",
  ["Golden Autumn Lake Order World completion reached 100%."] = "A conclusão do Golden Autumn Lake Order World atingiu 100%.",
  ["Golden Autumn Lake Order World completion reaches 100%%"] = "A conclusão do Golden Autumn Lake Order World atinge 100%%",
  ["Golden Autumn Lake Order World completion reaches 30%%"] = "A conclusão do Golden Autumn Lake Order World atinge 30%%",
  ["Golden Autumn Lake Order World completion reaches 60%%"] = "A conclusão do Golden Autumn Lake Order World atinge 60%%",
  ["Golden Autumn Lake Grape Atmosphere"] = "Atmosfera Dourada de Uva no Lago Outono",
