  ["Growing hair, oozing blood, turning eerily—does the windmill in Tingen's East District harbor hidden dangers?"] = "Cabelos crescendo, sangue escorrendo, giros assustadores – será que o moinho de vento no Distrito Leste de Tingen abriga perigos ocultos?",
